    "target": "lesson.prose[18]",
    "source": {
      "page": 243,
      "printed_page": 237,
      "block": "p0243#9",
      "sha256": "596d958785e8da22695c789506ce35f451aaba5f51511d1b8ac5accd63d3c43f",
      "pdf_sha256": "8070c333ee46fb0dc650cb32d4d898f605ed308559b6cc430425d908dae6b052"
    },
    "original": "$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$",
    "corrected": "$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$",
    "reason": "原页负数例的第二行在等号后直接印出根号，漏印负号。a<0 时 sqrt((-a)^2)=-a>0；代入 a=-1，原链中间项变为正 sqrt(2)，与相邻负项矛盾。只在现代层补该负号，忠实原式不改。"
  },
  "reviewedText": "如果$a<0$，那么$-a>0$，\n$a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$。",
  "mathematics": {
    "judgment": "The prescribed chain is valid for every a<0: sqrt((-a)^2)=|-a|=-a, so the newly negative radical product equals a*sqrt(2), as do its neighboring terms.",
    "signedSubstitution": {
      "a": -1,
      "correctedTerms": [
        "-sqrt(2)",
        "-sqrt(2)",
        "-sqrt(2)",
        "-sqrt(2)",
        "-sqrt(2)"
      ]
    },
    "imageAdjudication": "Inherited from the sole FIRST pixel load; no additional image read."
  },
